---
title: "The journey of one message through an agent harness"
---
flowchart TD
  A["You type a message"] --> B["Harness records a turn"]
  B --> C["Harness assembles context"]
  C --> D["Request to the model"]
  D --> E{"Tool call?"}
  E -- yes --> F["Harness runs the tool"]
  F --> G["Tool result returned"]
  G --> C
  E -- no --> H["Assistant answer"]
  H --> I["Streamed back to you"]
  I --> J["Turn written to the transcript"]
